    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Slaughter furries before they destroy your base! Get upgrades and climb leaderboards to be the best!<br />\r\nEndless Furry Tower Defense is the next level TD game with no end in sight. No &quot;win&quot; menu means you can only improve, unlocking upgrades and improving you kill count to be the best!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. Online leaderboards with anti-cheat<br />\r\n2. Multiple levels with unlock system<br />\r\n3. Multiple towers and tower upgrades (Over 10 towers with 2 upgrades each)<br />\r\n4. Four enemy targeting modes for making optimal strategies.<br />\r\n5. Game upgrades with an upgrade store<br />\r\n6. &quot;Roguelike&quot; gameplay loop (No winning, only getting better each time!)<br />\r\n7. Tons of gpu instancing and object pooling for optimal game performance!<br />\r\n8. Updates with new towers, levels and content",
    "about_the_game": "Slaughter furries before they destroy your base! Get upgrades and climb leaderboards to be the best!<br />\r\nEndless Furry Tower Defense is the next level TD game with no end in sight. No &quot;win&quot; menu means you can only improve, unlocking upgrades and improving you kill count to be the best!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. Online leaderboards with anti-cheat<br />\r\n2. Multiple levels with unlock system<br />\r\n3. Multiple towers and tower upgrades (Over 10 towers with 2 upgrades each)<br />\r\n4. Four enemy targeting modes for making optimal strategies.<br />\r\n5. Game upgrades with an upgrade store<br />\r\n6. &quot;Roguelike&quot; gameplay loop (No winning, only getting better each time!)<br />\r\n7. Tons of gpu instancing and object pooling for optimal game performance!<br />\r\n8. Updates with new towers, levels and content",
